  "details": "If you open up the Quick Menu or the Main Menu, and open up either the left or right wing (whichever wing is set as the Emoji wing), if you see the Emoji wing for the first time, the list of all emoji will be shown, even if you selected Custom, Recent, or any other tab that shows specific emoji.\n\nThis happens the first time you open the Emoji wing during a VRChat session. If you switch tabs, it will correct itself and the respective emoji will show normally.\n\nExample image below:",
